title:    How the implementation is organised
subtitle: Major directories only. Full source on GitHub.
width:    760
---
week-11-jit-access/
├── LAB.md                      reproduction guide: the Week 02 amendment, the 30-minute floor
├── terraform/                  the API, a subject that holds nothing, one entitlement
├── scripts/
│   ├── validate.sh             six checks; the denial is the one that matters
│   ├── request-grant.sh        runs AS the subject, stops at AWAITING_APPROVAL
│   └── measure-expiry-lag.py   polls until the binding disappears; read-only
└── docs/                       figure plan, references, screenshots

# terraform/  nothing here grants access. The entitlement is a template; the
#             folder's IAM policy stays unchanged until someone requests.
# scripts/    measure-expiry-lag.py has no write path at all, by design.
